      "path": "/summary",
      "value": "Senior Business Analyst and Technology Consultant with 4+ years of experience across global banking programmes at Citigroup (CBNA UK, ASW, PCAT) and ANZ Bank. Skilled in end-to-end requirements gathering, business process analysis, stakeholder management, and data-driven decision making. Experienced in Agile/Scrum environments with hands-on exposure to data analytics tools including Tableau, Power BI, and SQL, and certified in Generative AI for Consultants. Strong foundation in BFSI with experties in investment banking and capital markets, the ability to translate complex business problems into technology solutions across domains. IIBA-endorsed Agile Analysis Certification (AAC). MBA in Finance.",
